          "title": "波浪墙",
          "content": "<p>英国的很多砖墙砌成波浪形。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072803.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>表面上看，这样既浪费土地，又费工，但是它也有显著的优点。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072804.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它采用拱桥的曲面结构，具有更强的抗压力，所以比直墙更牢固，因此它可以修得很薄，比较节省材料。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072805.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202307/bg2023072806.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
